select id, 'en'::public.app_locale, $t$What's coming for 2027: projected brackets$t$, $t$test-brackets-2027$t$, $t$Tax brackets are adjusted for inflation every year. What to expect on your next return.$t$, $t$<p><em>Test post: review and edit this content before using it.</em></p><p>Every year the IRS adjusts the brackets and the standard deduction for inflation. Here's how it may affect you and when the official figures are published.</p>$t$ from new_post;

